    "body": "It does not seem to return an UNC path for long paths anyway. In any case, `dunce::canoncialize` is just `std::fs::canoncialize`, followed by `dunce::simplified` to remove the UNC prefix from `std::fs::canoncialize` if possible, so even a pre-prefixed path would be simplified.",
